I would be more inclined to try getting somebody to rebuild fedora extras and 
livna for AC. extras is  preconfigured in yum, and livna covers much of what 
extras doesn't have(in fedora)
http://download.fedora.redhat.com/pub/fedora/linux/extras/4/SRPMS/
